OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry through
OL,6,Fthe evening with increasing clear
OL,7,Fspells and light winds. Staying dry
OL,8,Fwith clear periods overnight. A chilly
OL,9,Fnight with a ground frost developing
OL,10,Fin sheltered glens.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FDry and bright but chilly
OL,13,Fstart. Sunshine turning hazy as cloud
OL,14,Fgradually spills east through the
OL,15,Fafternoon ahead of rain in the
OL,16,Fevening. Gusty winds developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
