OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FAny
OL,6,Fcloud and rain clearing east on Friday
OL,7,Fmorning to become dry with sunny
OL,8,Fspells. Bright spells and a few
OL,9,Fshowers in west on Saturday. Rain
OL,10,Fspreads east on Sunday.
